 alongside Particulars
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds two dedicated, word-wrapped columns back in — Account Head (the
contra GL account, previously the only thing shown here) and Sub
Ledger (the business-partner card, e.g. vendor/unit) — next to
Particulars, which stays the transaction narration per the prior fix.
Widened the page (1100px -> 1340px) to give the extra columns room.

Day Book already shows all three per line (account code+name, bp_name,
and entry narration), so it needed no change.

